WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
Night falls on an open plain.

2
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.700
Pilgrims in plain white
sleep on the ground,

3
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.310
rich and poor alike, under the open sky.

4
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.620
Before they move on, they
collect small pebbles.

5
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:16.020
At Mina, they throw seven
of them at a tall wall,

6
00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.320
reached by a bridge many storeys high.

7
00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.990
So what are they rejecting,
and why does it matter?

8
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.930
In this mission, you'll
follow the days of Hajj,

9
00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.080
from the plain of Arafat
to the valley of Mina.

10
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.600
Then you'll weigh up the gains
and the hardships of the journey:

11
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.300
heat, crowds and cost.

12
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.490
Your mission: find out
what the stones reject,

13
00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.910
and why that matters for a pilgrim's life.
